# =================================================================
# LogicGhost - Gemini API Keys Configuration
# =================================================================
# Add one or multiple Gemini API Keys (comma-separated).
# The system automatically rotates through all keys in a circular queue
# to balance load, give rate-limits time to rest, and ensure 100% uptime.
# Get free keys in 5 seconds from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# =================================================================
GEMINI_API_KEYS=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_1,YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_2
